Step 4: Decision Rule and Decision: We either reject H0 or do not reject H0 
Reject H0 if p-value &lt; \alpha{}

Don't reject H0 if p-value &gt; \alpha{}
 (Note: \alpha is usually set at 1%, 5% or 10%. The convention is 5%) Step 5: Conclusion State the conclusion within the context of the problem 
P-value smaller than \alpha{}
 There is sufficient evidence at 5% level of significance that the population mean IS ……(interpret H1 here). 
P-value larger than \alpha{}
 There is insufficient evidence at 5% level of significance that the population mean IS ……..(interpret H1 here). 11





